{
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Sam is replacing a legacy job that exports 40 accounts.",
      "file": "9cfc81a54964c952.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.552,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "f8e6dccf98450e6dc740e16e833df568c58268c2baf445f604e51f7706582378"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before switching, Sam has to show that the new export matches the old one.",
      "file": "9f33804931c2f5cb.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.84,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "99f7d423e5ecf1585b686a07e5ba673b6d01a3bcd15fadcce5bea622f467c276"
    },
    {
      "text": "Veridelta pairs the rows by account ID and compares each column.",
      "file": "bed1bae0d1a47a65.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.888,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "74c34477ea92e4f3a4d5668bc75c6e553d27d01425c1d175604e18d0fec9e66f"
    },
    {
      "text": "39 rows differ, and one account is missing.",
      "file": "617e094ef1768a7e.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.976,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "c671b6dd783ca2c87c15dfa8ce557579868a8e92862766ec3f89357a3bb83d2a"
    },
    {
      "text": "In CI, exit code 1 fails the check. But is any of this a real error?",
      "file": "03b8c63fbf8925c8.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.568,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "b8bf3c12371418cf1a806f33733f9ed29307074034d5c46d23d786d545ae5037"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rules say which differences are expected, column by column.",
      "file": "7bf50fbd5604b9b1.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.144,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "6d610eee3698401fc54f9c1cd11728dabb12f92080b00012cc7878ad8017872e"
    },
    {
      "text": "Veridelta cleans each side by those rules, then reports whatever they do not explain.",
      "file": "871ecb7c94d79b2f.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.704,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "b232bf73644f7f0999e97a94453a17d6646a83d2716f94231b37fef4ef74ec5e"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam does not have to guess the rules.",
      "file": "3ba7678e7d540bd9.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.28,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "aacce8bae85472aa4fe6c9852b4f83152062104f2c3c04e00c0511c23f948e9c"
    },
    {
      "text": "veridelta suggest tries each kind of rule on the columns that differ.",
      "file": "f00d7ee3a6ae092e.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.368,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "eb9c8c35ff4b5da688b3d6c9b4bb093fefe59bd6243a9057fc5b6e359f07c4c8"
    },
    {
      "text": "It proposes three, each with the rows it explains, and calls no model.",
      "file": "7040f8537898bdc8.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.008,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "8e08e63a0f7ee7449faaa7eb51ec9ae575bb0e14e875576ef0218a41d97d8244"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sam adds a map from the old status words to the new letters. The rules live in one file.",
      "file": "8a912a5890f6b20a.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.968,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "0fb84a39a4af391ff2f90630bab4cfe992d017b575acb6191eea5f62fb88fb77"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now only two rows differ.",
      "file": "332a4ed0e8f015f4.mp3",
      "seconds": 1.488,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "52153aa3baac78e79622e7bc98da044d3a69c749ab1fa9156486360f5511c37d"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rules forgive rounding, case, empty markers, renamed codes, dates, and types.",
      "file": "fc400711f5205542.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.856,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "e85ddab0a21fb10c0767856138f42ef682939cbf4a8fefa6a73f4ef3c8bc5440"
    },
    {
      "text": "They cannot do arithmetic, like rounding to a multiple of seven, or compare two columns.",
      "file": "4e7052dca64b2454.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.824,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "75b45e3824a934f465605fbfcce206859ff54969b1f0fd8fb9be08758976232d"
    },
    {
      "text": "Account 40 was closed on purpose, so a baseline file accepts it.",
      "file": "2916ec87eaca501b.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.864,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "8174cd8236a358b40f541f5199d9cf7798632e17f3e51da3d335d00541bd6b1c"
    },
    {
      "text": "The run accepts it, and one row still differs.",
      "file": "311a99426af2ca0f.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.904,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "4ff3047f2f9cc308f9c8a23fe6444bf1595912e90ac42fe00feb707b3f7e72be"
    },
    {
      "text": "So the exit code is still 1.",
      "file": "84b21f3310daf637.mp3",
      "seconds": 1.8,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "8f6fc67200014248662b098c0e870b6ae3720d426da71f750ecb6422c8f7fe3e"
    },
    {
      "text": "The report shows that row side by side. Account 17 moved from south to east.",
      "file": "cbe712d0c3144336.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.136,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "8fe3df17c37404f0cb230abbe466eebfaac9442caf2a491e6b6105eeb2b9bdb1"
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the real error, out of 40 differences.",
      "file": "de5a2ec28f196c90.mp3",
      "seconds": 2.736,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "8463f95c1382f1b624cf63827334e883a4eaaa3071abf17267b9283ebbf52257"
    },
    {
      "text": "On every pull request, the GitHub Action runs the same check, with the same rules and baseline.",
      "file": "7720b999e5326c06.mp3",
      "seconds": 5.4,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "9fcfba2434ef156c098ecec15bc696edca3db547b13a6c7574fba97bdf02b63a"
    },
    {
      "text": "It comments the result, and its check fails until account 17 is fixed.",
      "file": "661622f4f0ec1a88.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.248,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "8dadb17ab3b3dd7acb121f3e89c19c490b7473f7be0bca26afbfbd45f0b41d98"
    },
    {
      "text": "Agents can call the same checks through MCP, and warehouse tables are compared where they are stored.",
      "file": "956bf5c33eaf521a.mp3",
      "seconds": 4.92,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "eedc648ffdc397c93e91eac85149b0ceac83b740dcb3dcff40822c0e77a7e67c"
    },
    {
      "text": "Veridelta is early, and tested on generated data.",
      "file": "38097257d65b27fd.mp3",
      "seconds": 3.312,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "a404c626ab015ada92e48fe4e4c7db23dafba1290acc4449f7342b5d17b99e07"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feedback is welcome.",
      "file": "54de614a154aebb2.mp3",
      "seconds": 1.128,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "86db512612ea6558f31c99da911c76e5b372ca8ccd138e16dee145570f8259e6"
    },
    {
      "text": "Try it with pip install veridelta.",
      "file": "8e60aba70e6374bf.mp3",
      "seconds": 1.992,
      "engine": "gemini",
      "voice": "Orus",
      "sha256": "8814de3003407cb11d2304002a135926e662428fd779efd5269c8980debf2a9d"
    }
  ]
}
